  "id": "BIT-nextcloud-2026-82984",
  "details": "When a team was configured as \"visible to everyone\", the web UI correctly blocked non-members from viewing the team (\"You are not a member of ...\"), but the resources API endpoint could still be called directly, allowing any authenticated non-member to enumerate the team's internal resources and their identifiers.\n\nThis does not grant access to the contents of the discovered resources themselves, only their existence, names, and identifiers.",
